        "similarity_boost": 0.75
      },
      "performanceDirection": "[conversational tone]",
      "kind": "narrative",
      "id": "grounded_signal-brief-01",
      "speaker": "LAILA",
      "locale": "fa-IR",
      "text": "رلهٔ نظامی کنار فرودگاه غیرنظامیه. رله رو از کار بنداز، تجهیزات کنترلش رو بردار و هر دو متخصص رو سالم برگردون. ترمینال باید سالم بمونه.",
      "voiceId": "EXAVITQu4vr4xnSDxMaL",
      "voiceName": "Sarah (Captain Laila Nasser)",
      "assetPath": "Assets/Game/Audio/Narrative/CH04M04GroundedSignal/Voice/fa/grounded_signal-brief-01.wav",
      "durationSeconds": 12.4,
      "sha256": "001f273aeb6acf109258845064f9fb41fe03cacadfc9063ff77d3bc6b386efc6",
      "captionSha256": "704e9c887eb538970d8408c4d385c0e7123b265b06302f507a0cedc0dfa008b6"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrative",
      "id": "grounded_signal-brief-02",
      "speaker": "KARIM",
      "locale": "en-US",
      "text": "We'll unload at the apron and leave by APC. Keep the runway clear. Use the service gate to reach the compound, and protect our way back.",
      "voiceId": "onwK4e9ZLuTAKqWW03F9",
      "voiceName": "Daniel - Steady Broadcaster (Warrant Officer Karim Daher)",
      "assetPath": "Assets/Game/Audio/Narrative/CH04M04GroundedSignal/Voice/en/grounded_signal-brief-02.wav",
      "durationSeconds": 9.84,
      "sha256": "e7cff278552800ca413100f413da60351aec39c1f247a5dd8e651dbd59420ce0",
      "captionSha256": "0b7765b027157d673cf8b0ba22c7a3ba194405d9a0c834db1d52308d240762da"
    },
    {
      "deliveryProfile": "fa-conversational-v1",
      "voiceSettings": {
        "stability": 0.5,
        "similarity_boost": 0.75
      },
      "performanceDirection": "[conversational tone]",
      "kind": "narrative",
      "id": "grounded_signal-brief-02",
      "speaker": "KARIM",
      "locale": "fa-IR",
      "text": "توی محوطهٔ توقف پیاده می‌شیم و با نفربر برمی‌گردیم. باند رو باز نگه دار. از درِ خدماتی وارد محوطه شو و مسیر برگشتمون رو حفظ کن.",
      "voiceId": "onwK4e9ZLuTAKqWW03F9",
      "voiceName": "Daniel - Steady Broadcaster (Warrant Officer Karim Daher)",
      "assetPath": "Assets/Game/Audio/Narrative/CH04M04GroundedSignal/Voice/fa/grounded_signal-brief-02.wav",
      "durationSeconds": 12.08,
      "sha256": "282ea140634925cd2da5e51e10f828d61371826c4712ee2e1217ee91a888bdbc",
      "captionSha256": "ab460c8a6d412eedd2a6ba49e6b538017d3d12515d1074d8140a87ca76528019"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrative",
      "id": "grounded_signal-brief-03",
      "speaker": "YUSUF",
      "locale": "en-US",
      "text": "I need the control hardware, not rubble. Once the military relay is disabled, get us to the recovery point. We'll verify and secure the device there.",
      "voiceId": "cjVigY5qzO86Huf0OWal",
      "voiceName": "Eric - Smooth, Trustworthy (Chief Yusuf Darzi)",
      "assetPath": "Assets/Game/Audio/Narrative/CH04M04GroundedSignal/Voice/en/grounded_signal-brief-03.wav",
      "durationSeconds": 8.88,
      "sha256": "dcc94839f70c98a9db524b9c6666c393165712e8c622c2d95e900090b902cff7",
      "captionSha256": "7e73db236f34eb1c83f32b45e975a2342ade051ec7cd004b3c915ff262f81569"
    },
    {
      "deliveryProfile": "fa-conversational-v1",
      "voiceSettings": {
