      "id": "grounded_signal-comms-01",
      "speaker": "YUSUF",
      "locale": "fa-IR",
      "text": "اتصال‌ها با مشخصات رلهٔ شهری یکیه. این تجهیزات رو برای شبکهٔ ما آماده کردن. برای اثباتش هنوز باید خودِ دستگاه رو برداریم.",
      "voiceId": "cjVigY5qzO86Huf0OWal",
      "voiceName": "Eric - Smooth, Trustworthy (Chief Yusuf Darzi)",
      "assetPath": "Assets/Game/Audio/Narrative/CH04M04GroundedSignal/Voice/fa/grounded_signal-comms-01.wav",
      "durationSeconds": 8.64,
      "sha256": "d4cac17e1bd2ae39d7e6cf4c1e7a10b5bce21c6719e5dc1763a164042021c704",
      "captionSha256": "8455f941c47cf3043ccef651b4808d4d566577b8ab707ee5954f03ee6a904d07"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrative",
      "id": "grounded_signal-comms-02",
      "speaker": "LAILA",
      "locale": "en-US",
      "text": "Vanguard knows you're there. Keep the specialists together and the service road open. Recover the hardware, board the APC, then reach the guarded exit.",
      "voiceId": "EXAVITQu4vr4xnSDxMaL",
      "voiceName": "Sarah (Captain Laila Nasser)",
      "assetPath": "Assets/Game/Audio/Narrative/CH04M04GroundedSignal/Voice/en/grounded_signal-comms-02.wav",
      "durationSeconds": 10.0,
      "sha256": "3e21792c37ff961b04c0cfcc2dfe4626b0c0f22144187b9496ed4afb48136864",
      "captionSha256": "111a966221917bfbaad170ee53066c26f955d4e05060fd6599a4d16224853f89"
    },
    {
      "deliveryProfile": "fa-conversational-v1",
